kuntī-putro yudhiṣṭhiraḥ
nakulaḥ sahadevaś ca
sughoṣa-maṇipuṣpakau\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":281,\"bb\":260,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/1/16-18/b260/\",\"body_value\":\"kāśyaś ca parameṣv-āsaḥ
