yāvad etān nirīkṣe ’haṁ
yoddhu-kāmān avasthitān\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":301,\"bb\":278,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/1/21-22/b278/\",\"body_value\":\"kair mayā saha yoddhavyam
asmin raṇa-samudyame\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":302,\"bb\":279,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/1/21-22/b279/\",\"shadow_value\":\"arjunaḥ uvāca – Arjuna said; senayoḥ – of the armies; ubhayoḥ – both; madhye – between; ratham – the chariot; sthāpaya – please keep; me – my; acyuta – O infallible one; yāvat – as long as; etān – all these; nirīkṣe – may look upon; aham – I; yoddhu-kāmān – desiring to fight; avasthitān – arrayed on the battlefield; kaiḥ – with whom; mayā – by me; saha – together; yoddhavyam – have to fight; asmin – in this; raṇa – strife; samudyame – in the attempt.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"arjunaḥ uvāca\",\"translation\":\"Arjuna said\"},{\"word\":\"senayoḥ\",\"translation\":\"of the armies\"},{\"word\":\"ubhayoḥ\",\"translation\":\"both\"},{\"word\":\"madhye\",\"translation\":\"between\"},{\"word\":\"ratham\",\"translation\":\"the chariot\"},{\"word\":\"sthāpaya\",\"translation\":\"please keep\"},{\"word\":\"me\",\"translation\":\"my\"},{\"word\":\"acyuta\",\"translation\":\"O infallible one\"},{\"word\":\"yāvat\",\"translation\":\"as long as\"},{\"word\":\"etān\",\"translation\":\"all these\"},{\"word\":\"nirīkṣe\",\"translation\":\"may look upon\"},{\"word\":\"aham\",\"translation\":\"I\"},{\"word\":\"yoddhu-kāmān\",\"translation\":\"desiring to fight\"},{\"word\":\"avasthitān\",\"translation\":\"arrayed on the battlefield\"},{\"word\":\"kaiḥ\",\"translation\":\"with whom\"},{\"word\":\"mayā\",\"translation\":\"by me\"},{\"word\":\"saha\",\"translation\":\"together\"},{\"word\":\"yoddhavyam\",\"translation\":\"have to fight\"},{\"word\":\"asmin\",\"translation\":\"in this\"},{\"word\":\"raṇa\",\"translation\":\"strife\"},{\"word\":\"samudyame\",\"translation\":\"in the attempt\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":303,\"bb\":280,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/1/21-22/b280/\",\"body_value\":\"Arjuna said: O infallible one, please draw my chariot between the two armies so that I may see those present here, who desire to fight, and with whom I must contend in this great trial of arms.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":304,\"bb\":281,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/1/21-22/b281/\",\"body_value\":\"$25\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":305,\"bb\":282,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/1/21-22/b282/\",\"body_value\":\"As a pure devotee of the Lord, Arjuna had no desire to fight with his cousins and brothers, but he was forced to come onto the battlefield by the obstinacy of Duryodhana, who was never agreeable to any peaceful negotiation. Therefore, he was very anxious to see who the leading persons present on the battlefield were. Although there was no question of a peacemaking endeavor on the battlefield, he wanted to see them again, and to see how much they were bent upon demanding an unwanted war.\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 1.21-22\",\"medium_title\":\"Bhagavad-gītā As It Is 1.21-22\"},\"locale\":\"en\",\"activeView\":\"$6:props:activeView\"}]}],\"$L26\",\"$L27\",\"$L28\"]}]\n"])self.__next_f.push([1,"2a:I[83068,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n30:I[78455,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chu